sequenceDiagram
    participant Build as Konflux Build<br/>Pipeline
    participant AIPCC as AIPCC Base Image<br/>quay.io/aipcc
    participant ODHWB as ODH Workbench<br/>Base Image
    participant Repo as distributed-workloads<br/>Dockerfiles
    participant Registry as Container Registry<br/>quay.io
    participant KTO as Kubeflow Training<br/>Operator
    participant KTV2 as Kubeflow Trainer V2
    participant KubeRay as KubeRay
    participant WBC as Workbench Controller
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Build,Registry: Build-Time: Image Assembly (Hermetic/Konflux)

    Build->>AIPCC: Pull base image<br/>(CUDA + Python + UBI9)
    Build->>ODHWB: Pull base image<br/>(Jupyter Minimal + UBI9)
    Build->>Repo: Read Dockerfile.konflux<br/>+ requirements.txt
    Repo-->>Build: Multi-stage build<br/>(hermeto/cachi2 prefetch)
    Build->>Build: Install ML frameworks<br/>(PyTorch, DeepSpeed, Transformers)
    Build->>Build: Install OpenMPI + SSH<br/>(runtime images only)
    Build->>Registry: Push runtime training images
    Build->>Registry: Push universal training images

    Note over KTO,K8s: Runtime: Distributed Training (Runtime Image)

    KTO->>K8s: Create PyTorchJob CR
    K8s-->>KTO: CR accepted
    KTO->>Registry: Pull runtime training image
    KTO->>K8s: Create master + worker Pods<br/>(override entrypoint)
    Note over KTO: OpenMPI coordinates<br/>multi-node training via SSH

    Note over WBC,K8s: Runtime: Interactive Workbench (Universal Image)

    WBC->>Registry: Pull universal training image
    WBC->>K8s: Create Pod with NOTEBOOK_ARGS
    Note over WBC: entrypoint-universal.sh detects<br/>NOTEBOOK_ARGS → starts Jupyter

    Note over KTV2,K8s: Runtime: TrainJob Workflow (Universal Image)

    KTV2->>K8s: Create TrainJob CR
    K8s-->>KTV2: CR accepted
    KTV2->>Registry: Pull universal training image
    KTV2->>K8s: Create training Pods<br/>(override entrypoint)
    Note over KTV2: entrypoint-universal.sh detects<br/>no NOTEBOOK_ARGS → headless mode
